#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Build the illustrated quickstarts from the Markdown ones.

The Markdown guides in docs/user/quickstart*.md are the source. This writes:

    docs/user/diagrams/quickstart-<n>-<slug>.svg   one diagram per part, referenced by the Markdown
    docs/user/html/<guide>.html                    each guide as a Hangar-styled page, diagram inlined

    tools/build-quickstart-docs            # write both
    tools/build-quickstart-docs --check    # exit 1 if a committed file is out of date

Standard library only. Diagrams follow the diagram-design skill's Hangar profile (amber for the one
focal element, sky for PRs and requests, warm bone and instrument black, Instrument Serif and Geist),
and every page and SVG follows prefers-color-scheme; an embedder can force a theme with
<html data-theme="light|dark">.
"""
